SUMMARY:Deadline: MIT Museum: BRAIN Digital Content Open Call
DESCRIPTION:The MIT Museum seeks proposals for compelling digital content e
 xploring humanity's relationship with the BRAIN\, the museum's thematic fo
 cus from April to September 2027 bringing together art\, science\, technol
 ogy and design on cognition\, neurotechnology\, brain-computer interfaces\
 , mental health and the boundaries of ability.\n\nOrganisation: MIT Museum
 \nLocation: Cambridge\, Massachusetts\, US (content shown on-site\; remote
  creation possible)\nAward: Flat honorarium of USD 2\,500 to 5\,000 per se
 lected proposal\, at the Museum's discretion\nDuration: BRAIN thematic foc
 us runs April - September 2027\; selection finalized January 2027\n\nMore:
  https://mitmuseum.mit.edu/brain-digital-content-open-call?utm_source=arti
 ficialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://mitmuseum.mit.edu/brain-digital-content-open-call?utm_source=ar
 tificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Cambridge\, Massachusetts\, US (content shown on-site\; remote cre
 ation possible)
END:VEVENT
